<title>FRANCE: SGS-Thomson has no takeover plans.</title>
<headline>SGS-Thomson has no takeover plans.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS-Thomson Microelectronics NV president and chief executive Pasquale Pistorio said on Wednesday that the company had no takeover plans and was focusing on internal growth.</p>
<p>He denied a rumour the company might be interested in buying Cyrix of the U.S.</p>
<p>&quot;I have based our growth strategy on internal growth. Of course when there is an opportunity we will seize it but I do not see such an opportunity at the moment,&quot; he told a news conference on the company's 1996 results.</p>
<p>He said the debt-to-equity ratio at SGS Thomson was standing at a low 0.02 percent.</p>
</text>
